      "writtenOn": "2025-05-17T07:34:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Jingning: Instead of initializing those variables, we should instead make sure that the `cpi-\u003emv_search_params.find_fractional_mv_step` functions used  for unit tests set all the output parameters.\n\n`av1_return_max_sub_pixel_mv` and `av1_return_min_sub_pixel_mv` currently ignore their `distribution` output parameters.\n\nThis is the fix for a similar bug before:\nhttps://aomedia-review.googlesource.com/c/aom/+/195341\n\nI should have also set the `distribution` output parameter in that CL. Sorry!",
      "revId": "ee28c02bb2106089da36ddd60642ca9f90bde37e",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
